    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95339" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκύρβια:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρόμμυα</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκυρθάλια:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειράκια, ἔφηβοι</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκυρθαλιάς:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θεόφραστος τοὺς ἐφήβους οὕτω φησὶ
			καλεῖσθαι:</span>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διονύσιος δὲ τοὺς μείρακας</span>, Id.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκυρθάλιος:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεανίσκος</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκυρθάνια:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἐφήβους οἱ Λάκωνες</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Phot.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκυρίττω</span></b> ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυρίττω</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Suid.
		</span></i></div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
